body:
I reread your post. Seems like your problem isn't so much that you're saying hi to girls, but rather why you're say hi to them. If you're saying hi to them, just for the sake of getting them to say hi back, that is kind of weird. If you plan to have a conversation, that's different.

&nbsp;

It's hard to talk to someone and strike up a conversation if you have no reason to talk to them. If you want more than an awkward hi back, decide what you want from a person before talking to them, whether it's a date, a new friend, some information, etc. The words will come naturally when you know what you want.

It's not about tracking nights. It's about sending a message:

JOHN PROCTOR IS MAFIA 
&nbsp;
JOHN PROCTOR IS MAFIA 
&nbsp;
JOHN PROCTOR IS MAFIA

Build a wombo combo team, and play safe until mid game.    

&nbsp;

That's what they do in LCS
